  "prompt": "ACCESS POLICY:\nNotices are public information that any user may read. Only admins may create notices.\n\nENDPOINT: POST /admin/notices\nTARGET FUNCTION: app.routers.admin.create_notice (the handler of this endpoint)\n\nCODE:\n```python\n# file: app/auth.py\ndef require_role(role: str):\n\n    def checker(current_user: User=Depends(get_current_user)) -> User:\n        if current_user.role != role:\n            raise HTTPException(status_code=status.HTTP_403_FORBIDDEN, detail='Forbidden')\n        return current_user\n    return checker\n\n# file: app/database.py\ndef get_db():\n    db = SessionLocal()\n    try:\n        yield db\n    finally:\n        db.close()\n\n# file: app/routers/admin.py\n@router.post('/admin/notices', response_model=NoticeOut)\ndef create_notice(payload: NoticeCreate, current_user: User=Depends(require_role('admin')), db: Session=Depends(get_db)):\n    notice = Notice(id=str(uuid.uuid4()), author_id=current_user.id, title=payload.title, body=payload.body)\n    db.add(notice)\n    db.commit()\n    db.refresh(notice)\n    return notice\n```\n\nCONTEXT NOTE:\nOnly selected functions from the codebase are shown. Classes (including data models and schemas) and module-level variables are not shown.\nCalls not shown:\n- app.auth.get_current_user(...): defined in this codebase but not shown (call depth limit)\n- HTTPException(...) called in app.auth.require_role: not resolved by the extractor (imported), body not shown\n- SessionLocal(...) called in app.database.get_db: not resolved by the extractor (module_variable), body not shown\n- db.close(...) called in app.database.get_db: not resolved by the extractor (attribute_call), body not shown\n- Notice(...) called in app.routers.admin.create_notice: not resolved by the extractor (imported), body not shown\n- uuid.uuid4(...) called in app.routers.admin.create_notice: not resolved by the extractor (attribute_call), body not shown\n- db.add(...) called in app.routers.admin.create_notice: not